    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us6000tku7](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us6000tku7) Magnitude 5.6 earthquake at 10.0 depth occurred on Aug 14 2026 30km NE of Mbay. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude -8.3406 longitude 121.4284. It impacted 200190 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
